@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Order - Cancel Order Item

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Seller|
start
note right
Precondition:
The seller is signed in and approved.

Postcondition:
The line is CANCELLED, the stock returns and the order
total is recomputed. If every line is cancelled the
order is CANCELLED; pending payments are updated.
end note
:Choose to cancel a line and enter a reason if any;
:Submit the cancellation;
|System|
if (The system fails while processing the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Seller|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check the line is the seller's, not in a shipment, not cancelled and the order is not paid;
if (The line is in a shipment or the order is paid?) then (Yes)
  :Return the cannot-cancel error;
  |Seller|
  :View the message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
if (The line is unknown, another seller's or already cancelled?) then (Yes)
  :Return the cancel error;
  |Seller|
  :View the message;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Cancel the line and return the stock;
:Recompute the order total and update pending payments;
|Seller|
:View the result;
stop

@enduml
